<title>USA: Seagull, Global Natural merger final.</title>
<headline>Seagull, Global Natural merger final.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Seagull Energy Corp and Global Natural Resources Inc said Thursday they have completed the merger of the two companies in a stock swap valued at about $600 million.</p>
<p>As part of the deal, Global stockholders will receive 0.88 shares of Seagull for each share of Global stock they own. The newly expanded company, which will keep the Seagull Energy name, will subsequently have about 63 million common shares outstanding.  </p>
<p>Three Global directors - Global Chairman, President and Chief Executive Robert Vagt, retired  Getty Oil Co Chairman and Chief Executive Sidney Petersen, and R.A. Walker, vice president of  Prudential Insurance Co of America - will join an enlarged Seagull board of directors.</p>
</text>
